    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Felt warm last night; no rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Red, warm skin on the back of the right hand around a puncture; no blisters</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Finger movement normal; no joint swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness or tingling in the hand</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
